WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.076
Crust, mantle, and core describe composition. Lithosphere means rigid crust plus

00:00:05.076 --> 00:00:09.802
uppermost mantle. The asthenosphere below is weaker but mostly solid. The

00:00:09.802 --> 00:00:12.810
L A B separates those mechanical layers.

00:00:13.642 --> 00:00:18.376
His wood-block analogy explains isostasy. At equal density, a thicker block

00:00:18.376 --> 00:00:23.111
rides higher and extends deeper. Thick continental crust helps explain high

00:00:23.111 --> 00:00:23.542
elevations.

00:00:24.350 --> 00:00:28.831
At equal thickness, denser material sits lower. Compare thickness and density

00:00:28.831 --> 00:00:33.311
before predicting elevation. The floating blocks are an analogy, not a

00:00:33.311 --> 00:00:34.126
liquid mantle.
